<!-- Meteor 消费端静态地址本；列出服务的全部提供者地址，不限定协议。 -->
<!ELEMENT address-book (service*)>
<!ELEMENT service (address*)>
<!ATTLIST service
          group CDATA #REQUIRED
          name CDATA #REQUIRED
          version CDATA #REQUIRED>
<!ELEMENT address (#PCDATA)>
